------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Relationship to the Microsoft Xbox 360 SDK (XDK)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an independent, unofficial tool. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Microsoft. "Xbox 360" and related marks are
trademarks of Microsoft Corporation.

This repository does NOT contain or redistribute any Microsoft Xbox 360 SDK
files (headers, libraries, tools, samples, MSBuild platform files, property
pages, type libraries, or interop assemblies).

To build and use this tooling you must supply your own legally licensed Xbox
360 XDK. Two Microsoft-owned artifacts required at build/run time are generated
locally, on your machine, from your own installed XDK — and are git-ignored so
they are never committed to this repository:

  1. extension/Xbox360Package/libs/Interop.XDevkit.dll
     Generated from your XDK's include/win32/XDevkit.idl using midl + tlbimp
     (see generate-interop.ps1).

  2. platform/Xbox 360/1033/*.xml  (IDE property-page schemas)
     Copied from the Xbox 360 MSBuild platform installed by your XDK's Visual
     Studio integration, under:
       %ProgramFiles(x86)%\MSBuild\Microsoft.Cpp\v4.0\Platforms\Xbox 360\1033\
     (see fetch-property-pages.ps1).

A Visual Studio extension (.vsix) that you build locally will embed these
Microsoft-owned files. Such a build is for your own use with your own licensed
XDK; redistributing a built .vsix is outside the scope of this repository.
